WHAT THIS DOES:
  • Receives OTP requests from your HTML page
  • Checks disposable/temp email domains and rejects them
  • Sends a 4-digit OTP via Gmail (free, 100/day)
  • Verifies the OTP when user enters it
  • Saves the verified email + timestamp to a Google Sheet (if configured)
  • Sends a welcome email after successful verification
  • Returns the book download URL

SETUP:
  1. Go to https://script.google.com/ → New Project
  2. Delete any placeholder code, then paste the code below
  3. Click Deploy → New Deployment → Web App
  4. Set: Execute as = "Me", Who has access = "Anyone"
  5. Click Deploy, then copy the Web App URL
  6. In this HTML file, find "const API_URL" and paste the URL there
  7. (Optional) Create a Google Sheet and set SHEET_ID below to save emails


function doPost(e) {
  var data = JSON.parse(e.postData.contents);
  var action = data.action;
  if (action === 'requestOTP') return handleRequestOTP(data);
  if (action === 'verifyOTP')   return handleVerifyOTP(data);
  return respond(false, 'Unknown action');
}
function doGet() {
  return HtmlService.createHtmlOutput('PsychoSculpt OTP Service running.');
}
